              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, light armour. May take shield or buckler (+1 pt). Open Order. Any units may be designated Skirmishers at no cost. Must take 2+ units. (Vlad the Impaler p.79)</characteristic>
