              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Three crewmen armed with hand weapon and light armour. Two additional crewmen may be purchased for +10 pts each. Crewmen may have light armour (+2 pts each). Mantlets may be purchased (+10 pts per gun). Artillery. Medium Bombard confers D4 wounds. Bombards may only be taken in armies after 1392; one Mangonel or Top per 1,000 pts. (Vlad the Impaler p.80)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
